==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Jackie Peng]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*1 [[Chickful A]] spawns after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>.
*8 [[Gabriel]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 30~33.33 seconds<sup>900f~1,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Croakley]] spawns after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Though bringing a lot of slow-moving units is ill advised, the stage has very little threat as Croakley and Chickful A are easy to stall. Any decent damage option can deal with Gabriel.

